THIS IS NOT AN OPEN-SOURCE LICENCE

No permission is granted to use, copy, modify or distribute this source
code except as expressly set out below. If you are looking for an OSI
licence — MIT, Apache, GPL or similar — there is not one here, and the
absence is deliberate rather than an oversight.

This repository has been publicly readable. That made the source
available; it never made it free to take. Read it, learn from it, tell
us where it is wrong — all welcome. Shipping it, or a derivative of it,
as your own product is not.

The diagnostic domains and their weightings, the certification pathway
mapping, the regulatory index with its verification status, and the
benchmark provenance are the practice's work product. They are the thing
clients pay for, not a component library.


WHAT YOU MAY DO

You may use the tools published at https://jkassociates.enterprises, and
the outputs they produce, for your own internal evaluation purposes.
That expressly includes putting those outputs in documents you give to
your board, your investors, your lenders or your regulator. You do not
need to ask, you do not need to attribute, and there is no fee.

Every tool runs entirely in your browser and transmits nothing, so this
permission needs no account and creates no relationship between us.


WHAT YOU MAY NOT DO WITHOUT WRITTEN PERMISSION

  · Redistribute this source code, in whole or in part.
  · Publish, host or operate a copy of the tools, modified or otherwise.
  · Create or distribute derivative works from the source, the scoring
    methodology, the domain and question framework, or the regulatory
    index.
  · Sell or republish the content.
  · Present the tools, or anything derived from them, as your own
    product.
  · Remove or alter any copyright, provenance or proprietary notice,
    including the verification status attached to a regulatory citation.

Embedding is separately addressed: the scorecard is technically
embeddable but framing is restricted by the site's Content-Security-
Policy to permitted origins. See section 8 of the Terms of Use.

